  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the real numbers that satisfy the equation $|x-3|=4.$ So, we first need to solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|x-3| & =4 \\\\ x-3 & =\\pm 4 \\\\ x & =3\\pm 4 \\\\ x & =-1,7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solutions are $x=-1$ and $x=7,$ and both of these solutions are real numbers.\n\nTherefore, we can write the given set as\n\n$$\nA={-1,7}.\n$$",
